OL,3,V}yyy5CFriday
OL,5,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,6,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,7,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,8,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,9,     FElgar, Bernstein and Handel.
OL,10,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,11,     FJoe Stilgoe and his trio join the
OL,12,     FBBC Concert Orchestra and
OL,13,     Fconductor Fiona Monbet at
OL,14,     FAlexandra Palace Theatre in London
OL,15,     Ffor a concert of his own and other
OL,16,     Fjazz-infused music.
OL,17,G2145 The Essay: This Sounding Isle
OL,18,     FKate Kennedy walks the London
OL,19,     Fstreets following in the footsteps
OL,20,     Fof Ralph Vaughan Williams, to seek
OL,21,     Fout connections between a place
OL,22,     Fand the music it's inspired.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
